# Phase 8: Optimization & Professionalization

This phase addresses architectural inconsistencies, improves system performance through vector migration, and enhances production-readiness with proper logging and API unification.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Vector Migration Strategy**: Calculating embeddings for thousands of legacy rules may take 1-2 minutes on CPU during the first run. I propose running this migration automatically on startup if NULL vectors are detected.

> [!WARNING]
> **API Path Changes**: I will unify admin routes under the `/api/admin` prefix. This will require updates to both the Backend routers and Frontend fetch calls to ensure zero downtime and correct RBAC enforcement.

